translate brazil ch5sc10_dfde3963:

#   sy "They've always chosen a bodyguard from their royal guard previously."
    sy "Anteriormente, eles sempre escolhiam um guarda-costas da guarda real."

# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc10.rpy:33
translate brazil ch5sc10_8dda3719:

#   sy "But if they're worred that some retainers in the court can’t be trusted, it makes sense to get outside help."
